{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","versions":[{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R19-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R20-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478@rel:R21-11#67da0026","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R21-11","content":"This chapter describes how to derive all necessary data to assem- ble an OfferService Message: 1. Derive all static data from the configuration container. These are e.g: • Container SdServerService: SdServerServiceId • Container SdServerService: SdServerServiceInstanceId • Container SdServerService: SdServerServiceMajorVersion • Container SdServerService: SdServerServiceMinorVersion • Container SdServerTimer: SdServerTimerTTL • Container SdInstance: SdInstanceHostname 2. If TCP is configured for this service (configuration item SdServerServiceTcpRef exists): • The generator derives a SoConID out of the SoConGroup referenced by the configuration parameter SdServerServiceTcpRef • Call the Socket Adaptor's API SoAd_GetLocalAddr() with the derived So ConID to get back the IP Address, Transport protocol (Layer 4), and the port number needed for the Endpoint Option. • Build the relevant Endpoint Option with L4-Protocol set to TCP (shall be same as in LocalAddr) . 3. If UDP is configured for this service (configuration item SdServerServiceUdpRef exists): • The generator derives a SoConID out of the SoConGroup referenced by the configuration parameter SdServerServiceUdpRef • Call the Socket Adaptor's API SoAd_GetLocalAddr() with the derived So ConID to get back the IP Address, Transport protocol (Layer 4), and the port number needed for the Endpoint Option. • Build the relevant Endpoint Option with L4-Protocol set to TCP (shall be same as in LocalAddr) . 4. Build Configuration Option if configured (see configuration item SdServerCapa- bilityRecord and SdInstanceHostname). 5. Build OfferService Entry as described above.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_ServiceDiscovery.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:12:53+00:00","text_key":"29d380766faf"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","release":"R25-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_Sd_00478","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R19-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":[],"platform_releases":["R18-10","R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11","text_releases":["R21-11"],"presence_only":["R19-11","R20-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"unchecked":["R18-10"]},"element":{"kind":"requirement","name":"","module":"Sd","cluster":"","page":"","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R19-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1,"universe":"CP"},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-1def26d8fca78034","doc":"AUTOSAR_SWS_ServiceDiscovery","p":110,"rel":[],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"SEQUENCE_FLOW","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Assembling OfferService message data","n":4,"cap":"Figure 9.4: Sequence SERVER: buildOfferServiceEntry","sha":"1def26d8fca78034b6c901f3df7f73a7ead59491e1a992b234b1374cf4754b2b","nser":7,"src":"figur